{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>One who trusts in his wealth</b> — and not in HaShem: it will not avail him, for he will fall into the hand of those who seek his life, and the righteous who trust in HaShem and not in their wealth — will sprout and blossom like a leaf."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:13.709798780Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}